[12.067323, "o", "\u001b[2mGap detection \u2192 clarification \u2192 consolidation \u2192 contradictions \u2192 exports, over fixture extractions\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[35m$ uv run python3 scripts/demo_offline_build.py\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.526466, "o", "====================================================================================\r\nOFFLINE DETERMINISTIC PIPELINE (fixture extractions)\r\n====================================================================================\r\nchunks processed     : 5\r\nconsolidated vars    : 15\r\nconsolidated rels    : 10\r\nhypotheses           : 10\r\ngaps detected        : 10\r\nstructural coverage  : 0.50\r\ntestability          : 0.60\r\nclarification q's    : 10\r\ncontradictions       : 0 (0 unresolved)\r\n\r\nTOP GAPS\r\n"]
[17.527612, "o", "  - [medium] Relationship references variables that are not defined in extracted variable lists: anxiety, micromanagement\r\n  - [medium] Relationship references variables that are not defined in extracted variable lists: anxiety, team support\r\n  - [medium] Relationship references variables that are not defined in extracted variable lists: communication clarity, uncertainty about priorities\r\n\r\nCLARIFICATION QUESTIONS (researcher-routed)\r\n  - Q1: Which exact constructs define these referenced variables and how should they be measured?\r\n  - Q10: Which exact constructs define these referenced variables and how should they be measured?\r\n  - Q2: Which exact constructs define these referenced variables and how should they be measured?\r\n\r\nMERGED MODEL SUMMARY\r\n  15 consolidated variables and 10 cross-chunk relationships were merged. Workload shows a positive link to Stress (confidence 0.48); Team support shows a negative link to Anxiety (confidence 0.47). 10 scored hypotheses are ready for review.\r\n\r\nARTIFACTS WRITTEN"]
[17.528508, "o", " TO outputs/demo/\r\n"]
[17.996864, "o", "\u001b[32m\u2713 All deterministic phases executed; artifacts written to outputs/demo/\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.998304, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m"]
[18.089898, "o", "\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
[18.09413, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.094894, "o", "  The causal model \u2014 YAML spec + Mermaid graph\r\n"]
[18.142388, "o", "\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
[18.146194, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.147325, "o", "\u001b[2moutputs/demo/final_model_spec.yaml  |  outputs/demo/causal_graph.mmd\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[18.147457, "o", "\u001b[1mMermaid causal graph (renders in any Mermaid viewer):\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[18.198919, "o", "    graph LR\r\n        Workload -->|\"positive, conf:0.48\"| Stress\r\n        Teamsupport -->|\"negative, conf:0.47\"| Anxiety\r\n        Projectstructure -->|\"positive, conf:0.46\"| Self-confidenceatwork\r\n        Managerguidance -->|\"positive, conf:0.46\"| Stress\r\n        Managertrust -->|\"positive, conf:0.46\"| Self-confidenceatwork\r\n        Micromanagement -->|\"positive, conf:0.45\"| Anxiety\r\n        Schedulecontrol -->|\"negative, conf:0.45\"| Stress\r\n        Communicationclarity -->|\"positive, conf:0.44\"| Uncertaintyaboutpriorities\r\n        Meetingload -->|\"positive, conf:0.44\"| Stress\r\n        Organizationalculture -->|\"positive, conf:0.34\"| Jobcrafting"]
[18.203181, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1mYAML model spec \u2014 variables:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.259242, "o", "  variables:\r\n  - name: Anxiety\r\n    type: contextual\r\n    definition: Anxiety inferred from relationships across chunks.\r\n    aliases: []\r\n    chunk_frequency: 2\r\n    confidence: 0.67\r\n  - name: Self-confidence at work\r\n    type: contextual\r\n    definition: Self-confidence at work inferred from relationships across chunks.;\r\n      Self-confidence inferred from relationships across chunks.\r\n    aliases:\r\n    - Self-confidence\r\n    chunk_frequency: 2\r\n    confidence: 0.67\r\n  - name: Stress\r\n"]
[18.263768, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.264532, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m"]
[18.317228, "o", "\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
[18.320328, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.320519, "o", "  Quote-level provenance \u2014 verify before you trust\r\n"]
[18.380489, "o", "\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
[18.388013, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.388939, "o", "\u001b[2moutputs/demo/evidence_report.md  |  outputs/demo/methods_draft.md\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mEvery hypothesis carries its source quote:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[18.445176, "o", "  ### H1: Workload has a positive effect on Stress.\r\n  - Data confidence: **0.34**\r\n  - Literature consensus: **weak** (score 0.00)\r\n  - Novelty flag: **False**\r\n  - Supporting quote: _I feel overwhelmed when I have too many deadlines at work._\r\n  \r\n  ### H2: Team support has a negative effect on Anxiety.\r\n  - Data confidence: **0.34**\r\n  - Literature consensus: **weak** (score 0.00)\r\n  - Novelty flag: **False**\r\n  - Supporting quote: _Team support really helps when I'm stressed about deadlines._\r\n  \r\n"]
[18.446528, "o", "  ### H3: Project structure has a positive effect on Self-confidence at work.\r\n  - Data confidence: **0.33**\r\n  - Literature consensus: **weak** (score 0.00)\r\n  - Novelty flag: **False**\r\n  - Supporting quote: _When I have a clear project timeline and regular check-ins with my supervisor, I feel much more confident and productive._\r\n  \r\n"]
[18.454331, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1mAnd every extracted relationship links back to a chunk + verbatim quote:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.455507, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.506645, "o", "  # Structured model draft (machine-assisted)\r\n  \r\n  ## Structural coverage (heuristic)\r\n  - Score: **0.50** (see project docs for what this does and does not mean.)\r\n  - Testability (heuristic): **0.60**\r\n  \r\n  ## Extracted content\r\n  \r\n  ### Chunk `respondent_1_chunk_0`\r\n  - **Relationship** (direct): Workload \u2192 Stress \u2014 _More deadlines increase overwhelm._ (confidence 0.9) [evidence 1]\r\n  - **Relationship** (direct): Manager guidance \u2192 Stress \u2014 _Unclear guidance worsens stress._ (confidence 0.85) [evidence 2]\r\n  - **Relationship** (direct): Communication clarity \u2192 Uncertainty about priorities \u2014 _Lack of communication creates uncertainty._ (confidence 0.8) [evidence 3]\r\n"]
[18.5122, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.513008, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m"]
[18.568555, "o", "\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
[18.572669, "o", "\r\n  What the model still doesn't know\r\n"]
[18.620046, "o", "\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
[18.623719, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.624704, "o", "\u001b[2moutputs/demo/gap_report.json  |  outputs/demo/clarification_plan.json\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[19.639696, "o", "  structural coverage : 0.50   (heuristic)\r\n  model testability   : 0.60   (heuristic)\r\n\r\n  gaps found          : 10\r\n    - [medium] Relationship references variables that are not defined in extracted variable lists: anxiety, micromanagement\r\n    - [medium] Relationship references variables that are not defined in extracted variable lists: anxiety, team support\r\n    - [medium] Relationship references variables that are not defined in extracted variable lists: communication clarity, uncertainty about priorities\r\n    - [medium] Relationship references variables that are not defined in extracted variable lists: job crafting, organizational culture\r\n\r\n  clarification questions : 10\r\n    - Q1: Which exact constructs define these referenced variables and how should they be measured?\r\n    - Q10: Which exact constructs define these referenced variables and how should they be measured?\r\n"]
[19.641621, "o", "    - Q2: Which exact constructs define these referenced variables and how should they be measured?\r\n    - Q3: Which exact constructs define these referenced variables and how should they be measured?\r\n\r\n  \u2192 asking a follow-up researcher question next is recommended before these gaps can be closed.\r\n"]
[19.716506, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m"]
[19.779341, "o", "\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
