[19.843558, "o", "\u001b[2mEverything regenerated in the last ~10 seconds \u2014 reproducible from this commit\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[19.934564, "o", "  causal_graph.html                  6.3K\r\n  causal_graph.mmd                   599B\r\n  clarification_plan.json            5.1K\r\n  conflict_report.json               107B\r\n  consolidated_model.json             21K\r\n  evidence_appendix.docx              37K\r\n  evidence_bundle.json                20K\r\n"]
[19.935578, "o", "  evidence_report.md                 2.9K\r\n  extracted_models.json              5.6K\r\n  final_model_spec.yaml              7.8K\r\n  gap_report.json                    4.3K\r\n  methods_draft.md                   2.9K\r\n"]
[19.942793, "o", "\r\n"]
[19.943998, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32m"]
[19.991374, "o", "\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\r\n"]
[19.996003, "o", "  THE WOW MOMENT\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\r\n"]
[19.996253, "o", "  In one command, we turned open-ended survey text into a structured causal\r\n"]
[19.996326, "o", "  model \u2014 15 variables, 10 relationships, 10 scored hypotheses \u2014 where EVERY\r\n"]
[19.996708, "o", "  claim points at the verbatim quote that supports it, plus a documented list\r\n  of gaps and a deterministic evaluation with bootstrap confidence intervals.\r\n\r\n"]
[19.99781, "o", "  All of it:  fully offline, no API key, byte-for-byte reproducible. That is\r\n  the reproducibility research tools are missing.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[33m\u2192 To run the LIVE pipeline (with real LLM extraction) instead:\u001b[0m\r\n  export OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...\r\n"]
[19.997957, "o", "  uv run python3 main.py -i data/raw/synthetic_workplace_survey.csv\r\n"]
[20.0, "o", "\r\n"]
